The Copyright Holder retains ownership of the Software, excluding separately licensed third-party components and independently owned contributions. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.

Third-party libraries, frameworks, assets, and other components remain governed by their own licence terms. If this Licence conflicts with a third-party licence for a third-party component, that third-party licence governs that component.

