This Licence terminates automatically if You breach its terms. If the breach was unintentional, Your rights are restored when You correct the breach within 30 days after discovering it.

After termination, You must stop using and distributing the Software, except where applicable law gives You a right that cannot be excluded.

Rights already granted to the Copyright Holder in a submitted contribution survive termination.

